		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Small, fray-hided dragonkin that hides as a coil of rope. Pilfers food from supplies and pantries. Cautious.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 15, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +2 (1d6) or 1 rope blast, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Flammable</strong>. Takes double damage from fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Object</strong>. When still, looks exactly like coiled rope.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rope Blast</strong>. A near-size cube of twined filaments extending from dragon. CON 12+ or entangled for 1d4 rounds. Cannot use again for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
